all Household Appliances > Vacuum Cleaners & Floor Care Appliances', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-824i3-mpzlm24oaubz00', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1083800536%2F58213328706', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
