atável: o tempo todo [24/7].√ ———————————————————————————————————————————————————— Unove Frizz Calming Sleek Leave-in Conditioner 150ml shipping from Korea [Product details] Smooth even frizzy hair. Achieve sleek hair effortlessly. point 1 Lightweight cream texture absorbs fresh and evenly without clumping point 2 Smoothly controls frizz even at 80% humidity point 3 Protects hair from heat damage even at high temperatures 01 Frizz-calming solution that controls wavy and curly hair 02 Controls frizz for up to 72 hours without disruption even in high humidity 03 Protects hair from damage at temperatures up to 235°C 04 Lightweight, moisturizing milk texture, refreshing no-wash type A fresh milk texture that lightly adheres to hair, leaving only smoothness Lighter than oil essence, with a fresh finish that does not linger on hands The moisturizing cream-milk texture absorbs quickly without residue, caring for dry, frizzy hair. Its non-sticky formula allows multiple applications without clumping or greasiness, leaving each strand smooth and sleek. Blush Musk A sensual fragrance that blends sweet floral top notes with musk, softly tinting the senses like a blush. [How to use] Apply an appropriate amount evenly to towel-dried wet hair or dry hair, avoiding the scalp, and allow it to absorb. [Volume] 150ml #Korean cosmetics #K-beauty #good product #good price #Unove ———————————————————————————————————————————————————— 🩶Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√ ————————————————————————————————————————————————————', 265.0, 168.58, NULL, 'Beauty > Hair Care > Others', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-81zwg-mijpnxivsd1k76', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F57453428381', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (source, external_id, title, description, price, sale_price, discount_pct, category, image_url, affiliate_link, shop_name, rating, updated_at) VALUES ('shopee', '11881202315', 'farmstay collagen water full moist eye cream 50ml', 'farmstay collagen water full moist eye cream 50g Descrição do produto em inglês após português 🔸FARMSTAY Colágeno Água Creme Olho úmido Cheio 50g/1.69 fl. oz - Cuidados intensivos olhos - Mulheres vida útil perturbada rugas olho! - Creme de Olho Umedecido A Água Farmstay é um creme de olhos altamente concentrado que ajuda a cuidar das rugas ao redor dos olhos, a maior preocupação para as mulheres. 1. Camada de pele fina! Gestão necessária - As rugas ao redor dos olhos são finas e macias, diferente de outras camadas de pele. - Mais fino que outras camadas de pele, seca facilmente, e se aplicar Palmstay Collagen Água Olho úmido Cheio para os olhos de pronúncia de rugas, você pode recarregar instantaneamente. 2. Mantém a umidade e mantém a elasticidade - É um creme de olhos altamente concentrado, funcional cuja estrutura molecular é semelhante ao da pele humana, e o ingrediente de colágeno marinho preenche rapidamente os olhos com umidade e aumenta a elasticidade colapsada. 3. Ilumine seus olhos com função clareador! - Quando os olhos estiverem alegres, a impressão fica mais brilhante, permitindo uma expressão mais bonita da pele. [Moto de moedas] * Colágeno marinho para ajudar a melhorar rugas O colágeno marinho é um colágeno encontrado no mar e tem a estrutura mais similar à pele. Além disso, é um extrato natural que é excelente em melhora de rugas pois o conteúdo da ’erina'', aminoácido que ajuda a melhorar rugas comparadas ao colágeno normal, é cerca de 4 vezes maior. [Como usar] Pegue uma quantidade apropriada, espalhe ao redor dos olhos, e toque levemente para absorção. [Capacidade do produto] 50g/1.69 fl. oz #Colágeno Marinho #Creme de Olho #Alta Concentração #Ruga em Olhos redondos #Clareador #Melhoria das rugas #Nutrição #Humidade #Elasticidade #Cosméticos coreanos #K-beauty ------------------------------------------------------------ ---------- ---------- ---------- -------------------- ---------- -------------------- -------------------- ---------- -------------------- ----------------- ❤Three Promises of KOKSARA COSMETICS 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.✔ 2.We sell 100% genuine.✔ 3.Chatable time: all the time [24/7]. ************************************************** Description: 🔸FARMSTAY Collagen Water Full Moist Eye Cream 50g / 1.69 fl. oz - Eye care intensive care - Women''s lifetime troubled eye wrinkles! - Farmstay Water Full Moist Eye Cream is a highly concentrated eye cream that helps to care for the wrinkles around the eyes, the biggest concern for women. 1. Thin skin layer! Need management - The wrinkles around the eyes are thin and soft, unlike other skin layers. - Thinner than other skin layers, it dries out easily, and if you apply Palmstay Collagen Water Full Moist Eye Cream to the wrinkle-prone eyes, you can instantly recharge moisture. 2. Maintains moisture and maintains elasticity - It is a highly concentrated, functional eye cream whose molecular structure is similar to that of human skin, and the marine collagen ingredient quickly fills the eyes with moisture and boosts the collapsed elasticity. 3. Brighten your eyes brightly with whitening function! - When the eyes are brightened, the impression becomes brighter, allowing for more beautiful skin expression. [Main extract] * Marine collagen to help improve wrinkles Marine collagen is a collagen found in the sea and has the most similar structure to skin. In addition, it is a natural extract that is excellent in wrinkle improvement because the content of ''serine'', an amino acid that helps improve wrinkles compared to normal collagen, is about 4 times higher. [How to use] Take an appropriate amount, spread it around the eyes, and tap it lightly for absorption. [Product capacity] 50g / 1.69 fl. oz #Marine Collagen #Eye Cream #High Concentration #Wrinkle Around Eyes #Whitening #Wrinkle Improvement #Nutrition #Moisture #Elasticity #Korean Cosmetics #K-beauty ------------------------------------------------------------ ---------- ---------- ---------- -------------------- ---------- -------------------- -------------------- ---------- -------------------- ----------------- ❤Three Promises of KOKSARA COSMETICS 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.✔ 2.We sell 100% genuine.✔ 3.Chatable time: all the time [24/7].', 51.0, 47.5, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Eye Treatment', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/113b3060b63a3c9d1a4c6b992d07ab8f', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F11881202315', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
