cê ama. Apoio: Ferrero Tech – Tecnologia Automotiva. ______________________________', 773.6, 773.6, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Internal Accessories for Automobiles > Car Audio System', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-823ow-mp03plng6k8xd0', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F760857033%2F58211859008', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
